<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="548999213"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1770671795"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="The In Between"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Elephante / Anjulie"/><amll:meta key="album" value="The In Between"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:33.000"><div begin="00:15.957" end="03:26.530"><p begin="00:15.957" end="00:18.577" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25049">I've been a million places<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我去过无数个地方</span></p><p begin="00:18.777" end="00:21.793" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25050">At a thousand lives<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">体验过各种各样的生活</span></p><p begin="00:21.793" end="00:24.150" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25051">And I don't wanna take you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想接受这样的现实</span></p><p begin="00:24.850" end="00:27.865" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25052">Bet that sounds so nice<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但这听起来很美妙</span></p><p begin="00:27.865" end="00:30.280" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25053">And I wonder where you've been<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我在想 你到底在哪里</span></p><p begin="00:31.080" end="00:36.851" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25054">We are laying beside, are you satisfied?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你会降落我身边吗</span></p><p begin="00:36.851" end="00:40.845" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25055">And you know I don't need ya, need ya</p><p begin="00:40.845" end="00:43.422" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25056">If you need me, let me know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但如果你需要我 那就告诉我</span></p><p begin="00:43.722" end="00:46.987" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25057">I don't need you to be here, be here<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不需要你在我身边</span></p><p begin="00:46.987" end="00:49.552" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25058">But if you want me, let it show<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但如果你渴望我 那就勇敢坦白</span></p><p begin="00:49.552" end="00:53.105" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25059">These days gettin' darker, darker<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这些日子愈加暗淡</span></p><p begin="00:53.105" end="00:55.682" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25060">These days gettin' longer, longer<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这些日子愈加漫长</span></p><p begin="00:55.682" end="01:00.025" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25061">Oh, you know I don't need ya, need ya, need ya<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不 你知道我不需要你</span></p><p begin="01:00.825" end="01:02.950" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25062">But if you need me, let me know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但如果你需要我 那就告诉我</span></p><p begin="01:13.404" end="01:15.112" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25063">(Need me, need me)</p><p begin="01:27.994" end="01:30.047" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25064">We got complacent<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们都得到了满足</span></p><p begin="01:31.047" end="01:33.241" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25065">And I got tired of trying<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我厌倦了不断尝试</span></p><p begin="01:33.841" end="01:36.225" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25066">And the rooms kept changing<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">规则始终变个不停</span></p><p begin="01:36.225" end="01:39.464" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25067">We got stuck inside<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们深陷其中</span></p><p begin="01:39.464" end="01:42.002" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25068">And you get so passive aggressive<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你变得如此消极 咄咄逼人</span></p><p begin="01:42.502" end="01:45.234" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25069">And I'd say some shit, I'd regret it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我要说 真是糟糕 我后悔了</span></p><p begin="01:45.434" end="01:48.659" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25070">We built up our walls just to burn them down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们都筑起了心防 还是把它们都焚毁吧</span></p><p begin="01:49.801" end="01:52.896" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25071">And you know I don't need ya, need ya<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道  我不需要你</span></p><p begin="01:52.896" end="01:55.497" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25072">If you need me, let me know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但如果你需要我 那就告诉我</span></p><p begin="01:55.497" end="01:58.876" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25073">I don't need you to be here, be here<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不需要你在身边</span></p><p begin="01:59.076" end="02:01.581" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25074">But if you want me, let it show<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但如果你渴望我 那就勇敢坦白</span></p><p begin="02:01.581" end="02:05.099" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25075">These days gettin' darker, darker<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这些日子愈加暗淡</span></p><p begin="02:05.099" end="02:07.908" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25076">These days gettin' longer, longer<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这些日子愈加漫长</span></p><p begin="02:07.908" end="02:12.030" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25077">Oh, you know I don't need ya, need ya, need ya<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不 你知道我不需要你</span></p><p begin="02:12.830" end="02:14.897" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25078">But if you need me, let me know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但如果你需要我 那就告诉我</span></p><p begin="02:19.452" end="02:20.711" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25079">(Need me, need me)</p><p begin="02:24.714" end="02:26.995" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25080">(But if you need me, let me know)</p><p begin="02:31.752" end="02:32.857" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25081">(Need me, need me)</p><p begin="02:37.806" end="02:40.973" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25082">Oh, you know I don't need ya, need ya<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道 我不需要你</span></p><p begin="02:40.973" end="02:43.507" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25083">But if you need me, let me know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但如果你需要我 那就告诉我</span></p><p begin="02:43.807" end="02:47.092" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25084">And I don't need you to be here, be here<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不需要在你身边</span></p><p begin="02:47.092" end="02:49.507" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25085">But if you want me, let it show<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但如果你渴望我 那就勇敢坦白</span></p><p begin="02:49.507" end="02:52.936" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25086">These days gettin' darker, darker<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这些日子愈加暗淡</span></p><p begin="02:52.936" end="02:55.834" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25087">These days gettin' longer, longer<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这些日子愈加漫长</span></p><p begin="02:55.834" end="03:00.908" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25088">Oh, you know I don't need ya, need ya, need ya<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不 你知道我不需要你</span></p><p begin="03:00.908" end="03:03.343" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25089">But if you need me, let me know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但如果你需要我 那就告诉我</span></p><p begin="03:07.178" end="03:09.044" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25090">(Need me, need me)</p><p begin="03:13.895" end="03:17.080" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25091">These days gettin' darker, darker<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这些日子愈加暗淡</span></p><p begin="03:17.080" end="03:19.681" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25092">These days gettin' longer, longer<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这些日子愈加漫长</span></p><p begin="03:19.681" end="03:24.128" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25093">Oh, you know I don't need ya, need ya, need ya<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在 你知道我不需要你</span></p><p begin="03:24.723" end="03:26.530" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25094">But if you need me, let me know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但如果你需要我 那就告诉我</span></p></div></body></tt>